<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs020" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Four people in one row under a working title, each an identical cell with a circular portrait, a name, a role and one line.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="0Yr5sy0Qk9"><h2>The team behind the plan</h2><grid image-shape="circle" image-aspect="square" spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="15" id="SVxNDE7Dfr"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" meta='{"width":2048,"height":2048}' /><h4>Petra Toth</h4><p font-size="sm">Head of Operations</p><p>Owns routes, stock and the second shift.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="GvZHo73WsD"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" meta='{"width":2048,"height":2048}' /><h4>Marek Dabrowski</h4><p font-size="sm">Regional Sales Lead</p><p>Owns the standing-schedule accounts.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="zjDdacuFS0"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" meta='{"width":2048,"height":2048}' /><h4>Eva Wisniewski</h4><p font-size="sm">Finance Director</p><p>Owns the plan, the close and the review.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="15" id="NP3dLfnBIx"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" meta='{"width":2048,"height":2048}' /><h4>Tomasz Nowak</h4><p font-size="sm">Product Marketing</p><p>Owns the relaunch of the two new lines.</p></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>